"0":U @ sch-code
"":U @ sch-bik
with frame Dialog-Frame.
assign
p-name = replace(p-name, chr(34), chr(34) + chr(34))
p-name = replace(p-name, chr(39), chr(39) + chr(39))
p-name = chr(34) + p-name + chr(34).
run OpenBr in this-procedure
    (input false
    ,input p-next
    ,input substitute("and X_c-fin-bank.bank-name   begins &1 "
      , p-name)
    ).
apply "entry":u to sch-name in frame Dialog-Frame .
END PROCEDURE.
PROCEDURE proc-view-changes :
for each temp-changes:
    delete temp-changes.
END.
if not available X_c-fin-bank then do:
  Open QUery br-changes for each temp-changes.
  return.
end.
